00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.320
of the Kelly Clarkson
Show, want to celebrate

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.810
those creating fearlessly.
Just like you, ma'am.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.160
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:08.070
How's that sound?
(audience cheering)

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.290
- No way.
(Ariel laughing)

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.670
- [Kelly] Thank you so much Ariel

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:13.230
and thank you so much
to all our guests today.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:16.110
Lauren Graham, Mo Amer, Karen Taylor,

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.510
